    "text": "家人一度擔心他的咬字發音",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1320,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "但如今他以流利英文自信嚴漲",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1322,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "鼓勵更多盧言孩子",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1324,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "還決定要把這筆獎學金捐出去",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1327,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "惡劣的病人",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1328,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "他們的障礙就是在語言",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1331,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "對於這樣有語言大概不足的病人",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1336,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "但是他們願意用演講口說來表現自己",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1340,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "我覺得這件事情是給大家一個很大的勇氣",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1344,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "2002年起開辦至今的德輔獎助學金",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1347,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "陪伴先天盧言缺陷的患者",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1349,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "在課業或才藝等各個領域發光發亮",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1352,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "今年全台共有228位盧言孩子獲獎",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1356,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "基金會希望藉由頒獎",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1358,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "讓孩子在求學階段更有自信和勇氣",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1361,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "也有小耳症患者選擇把這一份與眾不同",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1365,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "活成自己的力量",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1366,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "小耳症對我來說",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1368,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "現在已經是一個獨特的印記",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1371,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "我認為小耳症對我來說",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1373,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "算是一個正向的事情",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1376,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "每位盧言孩子都有屬於自己的生命體會和故事",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1380,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "他們用自己的方式證明",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1382,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "差異不是限制",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1383,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "而是照亮人生的另外一種可能",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1386,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "同時新聞陳昌偉、朱鳳志臺北報導",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1416,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "感謝您收看這一節的公視手語新聞",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1419,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "我是吳嘉瑜",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1420,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "明天同一時間再會",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  },
  {
    "start": 1446,
    "duration": 7,
    "text": "請不吝點贊訂閱轉發打賞支持明鏡與點點欄目",
    "hasSignLanguage": false
  }
]